stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SupplierPending: Paid checkout store sub-order
    SupplierPending --> OperatorAssisted: Current operator-assisted route
    SupplierPending --> VerifiedAPI: Only after verified order-write capability
    SupplierPending --> Escalated: Supplier response SLA overdue
    Escalated --> OperatorAssisted: Operations follows up

    OperatorAssisted --> Accepted: Supplier accepts
    OperatorAssisted --> Rejected: Supplier rejects with reason
    VerifiedAPI --> Accepted: Verified API acceptance
    VerifiedAPI --> Rejected: Verified API rejection

    Accepted --> Fulfillment: Chosen route starts
    Rejected --> BuyerDecision: Buyer decision required
    BuyerDecision --> ContinueAvailable: Buyer accepts available sub-orders
    BuyerDecision --> CancelAll: Buyer cancels order
    ContinueAvailable --> Fulfillment
    CancelAll --> [*]
    Fulfillment --> [*]

    note right of VerifiedAPI
      Catalog API access does not prove
      supplier order-write permission.
    end note
